Modifications: the old ACS serializer interfaces and mutable fields were replaced
with an immutable Java record, a message ID, validation and native world persistence.
The old Forge, ACsGuis, DynamX, JDBC and voice-chat binary dependencies are not bundled.
The historical archive is a reference, not part of the E.D.E.N. runtime JAR.
No MrCrayfish Device Mod source or assets are included. Its shared-device/app
platform concept is an inspiration for this independent implementation.
